{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-04/1064969/block/singleImage/3273982/wm/01KP0JEJEBHNC0JD0JNW85GFK7.jpg?updatedAt=1795246597\"/><figcaption>葵涌一中學工程墮石屎，5學生被濺中輕傷送院。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>今日 (21 日 ) 上午 10 時 19 分，警方接獲一名學校職員報案，指葵涌安捷街一學校進行工程期間有石屎墮下， 5 名學生被濺中，分別頭痛、耳痛及眼受傷，由救護車送到瑪嘉烈醫院治理。案件列作「有人意外受傷」跟進，警方正調查事件。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.117709+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:36:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T11:17:13.032416+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T08:37:15.926544+00:00","content_hash":"d062923ab1ec75e904385fd903b4400c267aeaeb87f5364e547ff57ce25dcd6e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:43:53.117709+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}